             Dumps the current state of the Link.

     _d_e_v_._a_x_._X_._d_r_v___i_n_f_o
             Dumps the driver and controller firmware version information.

     _d_e_v_._a_x_._X_._Y_Y_Y_Y___r_e_g_i_s_t_e_r

